-- Couple Challenge content: 156 clean, friendly prompts in English + Hinglish.
--   70 Compatibility questions (7 categories × 10), 25 Memories prompts,
--   36 conversation cards (Fun / Deep / Future × 12), 25 Challenges.
-- Compatibility options are absolute choices (never "me"/"you"), so "about me" and
-- "my partner would say" can be compared directly.

